constraints:
1 ≤ N ≤ 10^{5}
-10^{5} ≤ Node Value ≤ 10^{5}
-10^{9} ≤ k ≤ 10^{9}

expected time complexity: O(N)
expected auxiliary space: O(Height of Tree)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def __init__(self):
		self.count = 0

	def sumpath(self, root, k, sum, d):
		if root == None:
			return
		sum += root.data
		if sum == k:
			self.count += 1
		if sum - k in d:
			self.count += d[sum - k]
		if sum in d:
			d[sum] += 1
		else:
			d[sum] = 1
		self.sumpath(root.left, k, sum, d)
		self.sumpath(root.right, k, sum, d)
		d[sum] -= 1

	def sumK(self, root, k):
		d = dict()
		sum = 0
		self.sumpath(root, k, sum, d)
		return self.count
